    "entry-00001": {
      "Id": "entry-00001",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Here is your pay. A different rhythm means different orders, so somebody above the tribals is giving them. Ask me who changed the drums when you are ready for the next job.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00002": {
      "Id": "entry-00002",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "You are back. We had two nights without drums, and then they started again with a different rhythm. Did you kill all fifteen Kwi Tribals?",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00003": {
      "Id": "entry-00003",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The Kwi are. They are the natives, and for a year all they did was throw rocks. This month there are war parties in the Hidden Cave and drums every night, so somebody has organized them. I need you to kill fifteen Kwi Tribals, so I can see how they answer. Come back to me when it is done and I will pay you.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00004": {
      "Id": "entry-00004",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Good. Kill fifteen Kwi Tribals, then come back to me here. The Hidden Cave is the closest place to find them. Listen to the drums on your way back.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00005": {
      "Id": "entry-00005",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The company sent a negotiator out to them. The Kwi sent back his datapad and nothing else, so we have not tried talking since then.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00006": {
      "Id": "entry-00006",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The Hidden Cave, north-east of the Jungle Landing, is the closest place. There are more in the Desert, the Cave Ruins, and their own Tribe Village to the west.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00007": {
      "Id": "entry-00007",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "I still need you to kill fifteen Kwi Tribals. The Hidden Cave is closest, and the Desert and the Tribe Village have more. Come back to me when all fifteen are dead.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00010",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00008": {
      "Id": "entry-00008",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "They go straight into the crate. Here is your pay. The war parties ran from the fence last night for the first time, so the fetishes matter. Ask me about the last job.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00009": {
      "Id": "entry-00009",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "You are back from hunting the shamans. Did you bring me all five Kwi Ritual Fetishes?",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00012",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00013",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00010": {
      "Id": "entry-00010",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Their shamans did. Yesterday we watched a shaman touch every warrior in a war party with a carved fetish, and after that they did not flinch at blaster fire. I need you to kill Kwi Shamans until you have taken five Kwi Ritual Fetishes from them, then bring the fetishes back to me. I will pay you for them.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00017",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00018",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00015",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00016",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00011": {
      "Id": "entry-00011",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Good. Take five Kwi Ritual Fetishes from Kwi Shamans, then bring them to me here. Some shamans will not carry one, so keep going until you have five.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00014",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00012": {
      "Id": "entry-00012",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "I will lock them in a crate and sit on the crate. Dr. Sol wants one of them to study, and she can have it when this is over.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00018",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00015",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00016",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00013": {
      "Id": "entry-00013",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "They stay a few steps behind the tribals. The Grottos, the Ruin Base and the Tribe Village have the most. Not every shaman carries a fetish, so you may need to kill several.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00017",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00015",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00016",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
