    "entry-00016": {
      "Id": "entry-00016",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Then we both did our jobs. Here is your pay, and take this Kwi Spirit Charm as well. It is one of the fetishes, restrung on a cord, and Dr. Sol says it is safe to wear.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00017": {
      "Id": "entry-00017",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "You are back, and there were no drums or war parties last night. A Kwi walked up to the fence at dawn, looked at it and left. Is the shaman circle broken?",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00024",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00025",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00018": {
      "Id": "entry-00018",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The last job is the shaman circle. The shamans meet, carve the fetishes and decide which night we get hit, and each one keeps a Guardian at his shoulder. I need you to kill five Kwi Shamans and five Kwi Guardians to break that circle. Come back to me when it is done, and I will have your pay and something extra.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00029",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00030",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00027",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00028",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00019": {
      "Id": "entry-00019",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Good. Kill five Kwi Shamans and five Kwi Guardians, then come back to me here. The circle meets in the Tribe Village, the Ruin Base and the Desert. Come back alive.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00026",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00020": {
      "Id": "entry-00020",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Then the company pulls out and the Kwi keep their planet. I will not pretend that would be unjust, but my people are behind that fence tonight and I am paid to keep them alive.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00030",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00027",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00028",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00021": {
      "Id": "entry-00021",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "They are the biggest Kwi you will see, and they never leave a shaman's side or fall back. Kill the Guardian first, or you will be fighting both of them at once.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
